#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/upgrade/4_2.rst:39
#: b2beacaeef6a49cc950a27092f39b642
msgid ""
"Create a :ref:`backup <user/how-to-guides/how-to-back-up-restore-and-migrate:"
"creating a backup>` of your current installation."
